  "description": "Harness self-test — machinery evidence, not a behaviour contract. Exercises the elevation repair event: with streaming on but no stream frame, two D polls and the closing P poll make a drive without stream positions. The first two polls are stored without elevation and not looked up, the declared terrain row of the P poll cannot answer its lookup at insert, so the drive closes with no position elevation and an ascent and descent of 0. The repair runs one pass of the production Terrain between two serves, with the real Log, on the replay clock — the drive dated 2024 lies in the pass's window only on that clock — and with TerrainMock answering the declared rows: all three positions of the drive carry the terrain elevations (40, 55, 50) and the drive's ascent (15) and descent (5) are recomputed; the car positions keep no elevation and the repair leaves no calls section. The asleep terminal is reached from :online and is therefore awaited.",
